FUNCTION FC 270 : VOID
TITLE = Orphan: a block nothing calls, for a first download to a CPU
// A block is only executed when another block calls it, and nothing calls
// this one. Should it ever be called, every transfer writes a value back to
// the address it was just loaded from, so bit memory keeps its contents.
BEGIN
NETWORK
TITLE = Load and transfer on bit memory, each value back where it came from
      L     MB 2040
      T     MB 2040
      L     MW 2042
      T     MW 2042
      L     MD 2044
      T     MD 2044
END_FUNCTION
